[node name="StoryItems" type="Node2D" parent="."]

[node name="ProtectionBox" type="Area2D" parent="StoryItems"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(470, -70)
script = ExtResource("3_story_item")
interaction_name = "Look under the tally desk"
flag_to_set = "dagna_payment_box_found"
discovery_text = "[b]An iron-bound strongbox[/b]

Under the foreman's tally desk sits a strongbox that is not in the mine's accounts. Inside, coin is counted into bags of ten, ready to go. Scratched into the lid is one stroke for every new moon, three years of them, and beside the strokes a single word: ROAD.

Dagna pays someone to leave the ore road alone, and the miners' pay has been short by exactly that much."
reexamine_text = "ROAD, and three years of new moons scratched beneath it."

