[node name="DeepVein" type="Area2D" parent="StoryItems"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(-170, -470)
script = ExtResource("3_story_item")
interaction_name = "Look at the boarded adit"
flag_to_set = "deep_vein_salt_seen"
discovery_text = "[b]The deep vein[/b]

A lower adit has been boarded over and chalked: DEEP VEIN - CLOSED BY ORDER - D.H. Cold air breathes through the gaps. The timbers inside are furred with a white crust that tastes of salt and iron, and someone has scraped patches of it away with a knife, carefully, the way you gather something you mean to sell.

The old miners say the deep-vein salt was worth more than the ore once, in the fever years."
reexamine_text = "White salt crusts the timbers behind the boards."

