[node name="RidgeTrail" type="Area2D" parent="StoryItems"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(-660, -420)
script = ExtResource("3_story_item")
interaction_name = "Look up the ridge track"
flag_to_set = "smugglers_trail_found"
discovery_text = "[b]A track over the ridge[/b]

Behind the spoil heaps a narrow track climbs west toward the ridge. Goats did not make these ruts. Narrow cart wheels, heavily loaded coming down to the mine, light going back up. A cairn at the bend carries a twist of iron wire.

West, over that ridge, lies the Darkwood. No crown map shows this path."
reexamine_text = "The ridge track climbs west toward the Darkwood."

